## 4. Technical Specifications & Challenges

| Technical Focus | Requirements & Strategy |
| :--- | :--- |
| **Scalability** | The backend database must be optimized for fast relational lookups across thousands of course codes, processing metadata and assignment descriptions without degradation in page load speeds. |
| **Performance (SEO)** | High Core Web Vitals (LCP, FID, CLS) are mandatory to maximize organic search engine rankings for competitive course terms. |
| **Future Phase: Subscriptions** | The architecture must support future extensions for user authentication/profiles and recurring subscription paywalls for direct library access. |
| **Future Phase: Marketing Automation** | APIs must accommodate webhook integrations to push captured email leads directly into email marketing suites (e.g., Mailchimp, Klaviyo) for lead nurturing. |

